WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.270
<b>Episode Twelve
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:34.220
Counting down!

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:36.390
Three, two, one...

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:37.590
Go!

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.680
Wow!

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.840
Most of the contestants were off 
the moment the starting gun fired!

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.720
In the lead is our animal summoner, Miaowu.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.260
She's using her cheetah speed,

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.640
and it's amazingly fast!

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:57.140
Neck to neck with her is a flying-
squirrel ninja from the north,

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:00.760
who's treating us to his 
amazing wind techniques!

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:04.430
Are you an animal summoner, too?

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.260
That's right.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.430
Nice to meet you!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.350
Close behind is second-year 
high schooler Ah Jie,

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.510
embracing his girlfriend as they fly.

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:14.340
How romantic!

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.220
It really makes you appreciate

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:20.300
how love truly can give you wings!

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.130
This MC gossips so much...

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:25.060
Exactly.

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.930
She's not wrong, though.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:28.970
Look!

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:32.310
Great Wizard Gan Diwen, a master of 
three elements, is charging forward!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:36.930
He's flying using a classic witch's broom, 
often found in fairy tales!

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:41.090
Right behind him is the mysterious 
poison master, Angelo!

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.810
Even more contestants are giving chase.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:51.390
We even have a father 
who brought his kid along!

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.320
Let's root for them!

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:57.390
Wait!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.510
Guess who I just found amongst the crowd?

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:06.450
It's the famous manga artist 
known for his endless delays, Hiro!

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:10.310
His <i>Killer x Killer</i> is 
known all over the world,

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:14.370
having sold over 230 million copies!

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.390
<i>Crap, I've been spotted...</i>

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.430
Hiro, I'm a huge fan!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.510
May I have your autograph?

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:24.120
<i>Time to split.</i>

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:34.220
He's drawing speed lines 
to increase his velocity!

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.140
Could this be the ability to 
manifest his art in reality?

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:38.840
How astonishing!

00:03:44.970 --> 00:03:46.720
They're cheating!

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:49.540
If you don't even have 
the cash to buy cheats,

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.660
come back next year!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.730
What was that just now?

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.260
A dark horse just blasted through the crowd!

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.100
It's the tech otaku Stan,

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.720
who's riding a rocket!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:08.490
In the blink of an eye, he's overtaken 
many of our contestants!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.300
Stan!

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.640
First place is mine!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.230
Hey!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:18.260
I'd really love to know where 
the hell you got <i>that</i> from!

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:20.800
It's a medium-range ballistic missile!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:27.100
Country U just happens to be running military
 exercises in the Pacific, so I swiped one!

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.590
I'm sure they won't notice, right?

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:32.970
I just hope they don't have 
a tactical nuke in here.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:34.590
Relax!

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:37.930
Hey, there! You're watching Furnace TV.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.810
The second floor race is 
slowly reaching a turning point,

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:43.890
as the distance between our 
contestants grows more and more!

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:47.600
Our fastest contestants have already 
overtaken our last place contestant

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.440
by several laps or more!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.720
Miaowu, Stan.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.260
Be extra careful from here on out.

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.800
Something big's about to happen!

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:56.800
How come?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.750
Don't you see the bitterness in their eyes?

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:04.760
The ones who've fallen behind 
are starting to realize.

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:06.760
They don't have to be fast.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:10.010
They just have to slow 
everyone else down to win.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.180
Deadeye,

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:17.680
lock on!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.530
Calamity Trigger!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:38.300
Don't do it! I thought we were friends!

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.180
You fool.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:41.970
In the Demon Furnace's arena,

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:45.110
there are no friends. Only enemies.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.390
More people came to die, huh?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.720
Six-Shot Slayer!

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.390
Ah Jie, watch out!

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:56.610
This is bad!

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.680
His bullets can curve!

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:01.540
We can't shake them.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:04.360
In that case,

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:10.470
I guess we gotta return to sender.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.720
Wow!

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:19.560
The race is reaching its climax,

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.430
and our contestants are 
pulling out all the stops!

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:23.090
The situation's getting out of control!

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:25.430
Look, up ahead!

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:28.800
The mysterious poison master is releasing 
large clouds of mist onto the track!

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:31.590
And without exception, all contestants 
who ran through the mist

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:35.050
are now suffering from breathing 
difficulties and muscle spasms!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:40.270
Some are even losing their sanity 
and falling off the side!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.510
Despicable! How could you use nerve gas?!

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:46.340
Stop at once!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:49.160
Venomous Snake Form!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.590
You can't kill air.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.430
That's right.

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.550
Luckily, though, I just made a new friend.

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.860
He can control wind.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:08.640
Squirrel Ninja Arts: Wind Technique!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.760
Tornado!

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:21.930
Nice working with you!

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:22.840
Nice working with you!

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:29.100
Here comes trouble again.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.350
We'd only just cleared 
the air of that biohazard,

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:35.000
and now someone's 
playing hack-and-slash.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:39.050
I'm seriously this close to calling the cops.

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:41.510
No!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.370
Stay away!

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:51.060
We'll surrender right now! 
We won't get in your way!

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:54.430
Please, let us go!

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:58.640
No mercy!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.470
Crap, they're not gonna make it!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.140
Taste my missile!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.150
What?

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:21.810
It's over!

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:30.970
Why is victory more important 
to you than life?

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.990
Why betray others?

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:36.010
Why won't you people understand?

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:40.840
Friendship and effort are always 
more important than victory!

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:38.260
<b>FRIENDSHIP</b>

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.140
<b>EFFORT</b>

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.840
<b>VICTORY</b>

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:51.220
Amazing!

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:54.390
He's manifesting lightning from screentones!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.260
All right, then.

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.260
I'll grant you your wish!

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:05.510
Finishing Blow: Ink-Stroke Slash!

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:12.890
His ink strokes turned into blade slashes!

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:15.520
<b>Slash</b>

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:16.300
<b>Slash</b>

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.550
You got what was coming to you.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:28.640
Stan, you all right?

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:30.530
Not to worry!

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:34.300
My idol Hiro-san{actually spoken} came to my rescue!

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:37.340
Right, may I have your autograph, please?

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:40.430
No worries.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:44.390
Wow! A thrilling match that grips 
our hearts and won't let go!

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.560
After all the bad news,

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:50.340
I have one piece of very 
good news for everyone!

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:53.340
Right now, there are less 
than fifteen contestants

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:55.340
who are not yet incapacitated.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.300
In other words...

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:01.190
You just have to make it 
to the goal to win!

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.610
Thank goodness we made it!

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.010
We can't stop yet.

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:10.360
After all, we're here...

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:12.590
...to take first place!

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.500
Wait for me!

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:51.340
Shadow Clone!

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:13.840
Got you!

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.430
Let's see you dodge this!

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:26.800
Dark Shadow Blade!

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:29.140
Take this!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.090
Hey, that's enough, you two!

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:47.560
Are we really so bored that 
we're fighting to kill time?

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.490
It really is...

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:53.970
...kind of ridiculous.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:56.310
I don't get it at all.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:59.080
Why won't the boss let us 
storm the Demon Furnace?

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.350
Going by pure strength,

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:03.340
I could take a hundred of them by myself!

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.690
Don't think too much about it.

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:08.840
He's gotta have his reasons.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.800
Well, while the boss is gone,

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:14.800
let me tell you something.

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:19.300
That day, after Bonnie came to stop us,

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:23.430
I actually sneaked into the Demon 
Furnace by myself that very same night.

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:27.340
H-How come you didn't bring me along?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:30.760
The arena was already closed at the time.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:34.500
I tried teleporting from the outside, 
as well as digging a hole through the wall.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.550
I just couldn't get in.

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.840
I even got chased down a 
few streets by security.

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:43.770
Not even your spatial 
slashing can cut through it?

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.760
It's gotta be an invisible barrier.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:50.560
In the end, all I could do was walk 
around Furnace Town's night markets,

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.760
buy some souvenirs, and come home.

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:58.220
Take a look at this.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:01.860
It's a super-cool antique TV!

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.970
It picks up all kinds of amazing shows!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.690
Hey, I'm not in the mood for TV.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.110
Take a look at what I found!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.350
<i>Welcome to Furnace TV!</i>

00:13:14.970 --> 00:13:19.180
<i>Let me, Bonnie, show you the highlights 
of the last couple days' arena matches!</i>

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.890
<i>On the second floor racetracks,</i>

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:25.090
<i>Miaowu took the crown thanks 
to her natural abilities!</i>

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:28.970
<i>Ah Jie took second place with 
just a half-second difference,</i>

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:31.590
<i>and the bronze goes to 
manga artist Hiro!</i>

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.410
Those bloody savages!

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:37.510
<i>After a difficult test of speed,</i>

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:40.760
<i>most of our contestants 
were bound to be starving.</i>

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:44.800
<i>Our thoughtful hosts knew that,</i>

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:49.090
<i>and arranged for a cooking 
competition on the third floor!</i>

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.140
<i>In this battle of culinary skill,</i>

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.470
<i>Ah Jie snatched the hearts 
of all the judges there</i>

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:57.730
<i>with his signature beef ramen!</i>

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:02.050
<i>How is this so good?! 
I can't get enough of it!</i>

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.720
<i>As for Miaowu, who has no 
cooking experience to speak of,</i>

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.390
<i>she thought outside the box</i>

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:10.850
<i>and used her claws to prepare the most 
natural and wild dish we've ever seen!</i>

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:13.690
<i>If you can't cook, 
then you just gotta eat raw!</i>

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:19.840
<i>After all that good grub, the hottest 
dessert was this robot ice cream!</i>

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.970
Just watching this makes me hungry.

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:27.010
How are any of these trials? 
It's a retaliation against society!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.510
<i>I'm stuffed.</i>

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:32.260
<i>Now that we're all filled up, what's next?</i>

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.890
<i>Karaoke, of course!</i>

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.260
<i>That's right.</i>

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:41.430
<i>To give our contestants a brief respite 
from these tense competitions,</i>

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:45.260
<i>the fourth floor's trial is designed 
to be simple and relaxing.</i>

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:51.140
Hi, everybody! I'm the boss of this floor.

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:55.310
The death-metal rock star Devil 
Lipstick is leading the charge!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:59.970
Her "Hell's Requiem" sure got 
the entire crowd fired up!

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:03.470
Supposedly, her music can slay 
the living and wake the dead!

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:06.900
Listening to it makes you die 
over and over! This is terrible!

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.600
Frankenstein's kid isn't happy!

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:14.430
He cries at over 500 decibels,

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:17.390
taking first place for this trial!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:25.170
Food and karaoke... Is this 
meant to be a holiday?!

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:28.870
Those jackasses are having it way 
too easy at the Demon Furnace!

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.060
Hey.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:33.550
You seem pretty tense.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:36.510
Huanxin.

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:37.500
Boss.

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.100
When did you get here?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:42.360
P-Please, let me explain.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:46.650
Looks like you girls can't stop thinking 
about Ah Jie and the Demon Furnace.

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:51.680
It pisses me off to watch our enemies 
stuff their faces and have fun!

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:53.020
Calm down.

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.100
Oh, that reminds me.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.360
You three haven't been to the Demon Furnace.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:03.550
For a Summoner, that's like missing 
an important part of your life.

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:07.100
Why don't we give them a week to 
vacation there and have some fun

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:08.520
with Ah Jie and his friends?

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:11.510
Sure.

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:13.600
Did I hear that right?

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:14.470
Really?

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.940
That said, you'll have a new friend

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.800
coming with you.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:23.730
It's him.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.610
When you see Ah Jie, you can tell him

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.150
that I've sent them all

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:31.860
a surprise gift.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:40.480
Elders, allow me to fill you 
in on the current situation.

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:44.840
The competitions for this 
season's group 7 are ongoing.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:48.310
Ninety-two contestants signed up.

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:51.350
At the Furnace Hotel on the 
first floor, 62 were eliminated.

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:54.140
On the second floor's racetrack, 
15 were eliminated.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.720
No one was eliminated on the third floor.

00:16:55.720 --> 00:16:57.260
No one was eliminated on the fourth floor.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:01.220
In total, 15 contestants 
made it to the fifth floor.

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:02.380
Here they are.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.590
Dark Hoof Dwarf Gaodeng, 
traveling merchant Li Chad,

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:09.550
Flying Squirrel Ninja, manga artist Hiro,

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:12.010
Zhang Zhiming, Li Chunjiao,

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.470
Frankenstein and his son,

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:17.050
Hoppy Baby, Devil Lipstick,

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:19.010
Poison Master, Mummy,

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:22.110
Stan, Miaowu, and Ah Jie.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.680
Of the eliminated contestants,

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:27.010
more than half signed up again

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:30.010
and will start over from the first floor.

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:34.520
Show us the numbers across 
